     When measuring the similarity between artist vi and artist vj , we need to first identify their




                                                                                   型
 rough similarity calculated by each embedding. For the kth 3-dimensional embedding (k=1, 2, ...,
 q), we define its rough similarity srk as




                                                                  模
                                         srk = 1 − kCi − Cj k2                                            (5)




                                                                 学
     Let Sr be the random variable where srk (k = 1, 2, ..., q) are the specific value. Therefore, the
 q rough similarity labeled from sr1 to srq can form a probability distribution. The actual similarity
 Sij between vi and vj is defined as the expectation value of the distribution, formulated in Eq. (6).




                                                         数
                                              Sij = E(Sr)                                                 (6)

                                         ：
 where Sij ∈ [0, 1], and E(Sr) is the expectation of random variable Sr. When Sij is large, it




